Subject: [PATCH 817/822] perf(dsv41): optimize TileLang sparse MLA, indexer,
 front, and SP prefill

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354
with candidate-60 series applied through 0816.

Rationale: Tunes decode/prefill sparse MLA, indexer top-k segments, metadata
preparation, front projections, compressor, and SP prefill overlap on GB10.

Quality implications: None; sparse MLA, front, and metadata unit tests pass
against torch references.

Tests: pytest -q -p deepseek_models tests/kernels/attention/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang.py tests/kernels/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_front.py tests/kernels/test_deepseek_v41_tilelang_metadata.py

